From 35c76d17767c02230e70c0adbb5f680296138d19 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Grische <github@grische.xyz>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:19:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] patches/openwrt: mediatek: fix D-Link M60 multi-pack MAC
 addresses

D-Link AQUILA PRO AI M60 units sold in a multi-pack all get the same
MAC addresses, because the device tree reads the base address from a
fixed offset in the Odm partition. Switch the M60 to the AMIT P-section
layout, which finds the address by its record ID. Single-pack units
keep their addresses.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
